  "solution": "<ol class=\"alpha-list\"><li>Theo định nghĩa ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover><mn>0</mn><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover></mrow></semantics></math>.\n\t\t\tVậy mệnh đề đã cho đúng.</li><li>Theo quy tắc ba điểm ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>M</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover></mrow></semantics></math>.\n\t\t\tVậy mệnh đề đã cho sai.</li><li>Vì <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>M</mi></semantics></math> là trung điểm <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow></semantics></math> nên <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover><mn>0</mn><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover></mrow></semantics></math>.\n\t\t\tVậy mệnh đề đã cho đúng.</li><li>Theo quy tắc ba điểm ta có \n\t\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>M</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>M</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><mover><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>≠</mo><mover><mn>0</mn><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math></div>\n\t\t\tVậy mệnh đề đã cho sai.</li></ol>",
